          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bor apama luŋ, cakere i doggola tuŋ cel mano amana, naka i doggola tuŋ ocele, romo yadi tutumia apar wie aryo i mia aryo i pyeraboro. Nyiŋ boma-naca cakere kare-naca olwoŋo ni, “Rwot tye kan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.35",
